{"definition":"For each vertex \\(v\\in V(G)\\), form \\(G-v\\) by deleting \\(v\\) and all incident edges. This invariant counts the vertices for which \\(\\gamma(G-v) > \\gamma(G)\\), where \\(\\gamma\\) denotes the domination number. In other words, it measures how many single-vertex deletions make the domination number strictly increase.","dependencies":[],"dimension":null,"exactness":"exact","expression":{"arguments":[{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}}],"kind":"application","symbol":"graph_theory.gamma_vertex_critical_increase_count"},"hypothesis_eligible":false,"key":"graph_theory.gamma_vertex_critical_increase_count","name":"Domination increase-critical vertex count","observation_key":"gamma_vertex_critical_increase_count","predictor_eligible":true,"provenance_references":["reference:theo-conjecture-web-fresh-graph-registry","source:theox-graph-template-normalization"],"role":"established","scalar_constraints":[],"subject":{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}},"target_eligible":true,"unit":null,"value_kind":"integer","value_sort":{"key":"core.integer_value","parameters":[]}}
{"definition":"For each vertex \\(v\\), let \\(\\deg(v)\\) be its degree. The harmonic index \\(H(G)\\) is obtained by summing the edge contribution \\(2/(\\deg(u)+\\deg(v))\\) over all edges \\(uv\\in E(G)\\). The value depends only on the degrees of adjacent vertex pairs.","dependencies":[],"dimension":null,"exactness":"approximate","expression":{"arguments":[{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}}],"kind":"application","symbol":"graph_theory.harmonic_index"},"hypothesis_eligible":false,"key":"graph_theory.harmonic_index","name":"Harmonic index","observation_key":"harmonic_index","predictor_eligible":true,"provenance_references":["reference:theo-conjecture-web-fresh-graph-registry","source:theox-graph-template-normalization"],"role":"established","scalar_constraints":[],"subject":{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}},"target_eligible":true,"unit":null,"value_kind":"real","value_sort":{"key":"core.real_value","parameters":[]}}
