{"definition":"A set \\(S\\subseteq V(G)\\) is a 2-dominating set if every vertex \\(v\\in V(G)\\setminus S\\) satisfies \\(|N(v)\\cap S|\\ge 2\\). The 2-domination number \\(\\gamma_{2}(G)\\) is the minimum cardinality of a 2-dominating set.","dependencies":[],"dimension":null,"exactness":"exact","expression":{"arguments":[{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}}],"kind":"application","symbol":"graph_theory.two_domination_number"},"hypothesis_eligible":false,"key":"graph_theory.two_domination_number","name":"2-domination number","observation_key":"two_domination_number","predictor_eligible":true,"provenance_references":["reference:theo-conjecture-web-fresh-graph-registry","source:theox-graph-template-normalization"],"role":"established","scalar_constraints":[],"subject":{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}},"target_eligible":true,"unit":null,"value_kind":"integer","value_sort":{"key":"core.integer_value","parameters":[]}}
{"definition":"A 2-rainbow dominating function assigns to each vertex a subset of \\(\\{1,2\\}\\). A vertex assigned the empty set must have neighbors whose assigned color sets together contain both colors 1 and 2. The weight is \\(\\sum_{v\\in V(G)} |f(v)|\\). The 2-rainbow domination number \\(\\gamma_{r,2}(G)\\) is the minimum possible weight.","dependencies":[],"dimension":null,"exactness":"exact","expression":{"arguments":[{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}}],"kind":"application","symbol":"graph_theory.two_rainbow_domination_number"},"hypothesis_eligible":false,"key":"graph_theory.two_rainbow_domination_number","name":"2-rainbow domination number","observation_key":"two_rainbow_domination_number","predictor_eligible":true,"provenance_references":["reference:theo-conjecture-web-fresh-graph-registry","source:theox-graph-template-normalization"],"role":"established","scalar_constraints":[],"subject":{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}},"target_eligible":true,"unit":null,"value_kind":"integer","value_sort":{"key":"core.integer_value","parameters":[]}}
{"definition":"A vertex clique cover, or clique partition, is a collection of cliques whose vertex sets are pairwise disjoint and whose union is \\(V(G)\\). The vertex clique cover number \\(\\theta(G)\\) is the minimum number of cliques in such a partition.","dependencies":[],"dimension":null,"exactness":"exact","expression":{"arguments":[{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}}],"kind":"application","symbol":"graph_theory.vertex_clique_cover_number"},"hypothesis_eligible":false,"key":"graph_theory.vertex_clique_cover_number","name":"Vertex clique cover number","observation_key":"vertex_clique_cover_number","predictor_eligible":true,"provenance_references":["reference:theo-conjecture-web-fresh-graph-registry","source:theox-graph-template-normalization"],"role":"established","scalar_constraints":[],"subject":{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}},"target_eligible":true,"unit":null,"value_kind":"integer","value_sort":{"key":"core.integer_value","parameters":[]}}
{"definition":"For a connected graph of order at least two, \\(\\kappa(G)\\) is the minimum cardinality of a set \\(S\\subset V(G)\\) such that \\(G-S\\) is disconnected or has one vertex. This registry sets \\(\\kappa(G)=0\\) for empty, one-vertex, or disconnected graphs; in particular, \\(\\kappa(K_n)=n-1\\) for \\(n\\geq2\\).","dependencies":[],"dimension":null,"exactness":"exact","expression":{"arguments":[{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}}],"kind":"application","symbol":"graph_theory.vertex_connectivity"},"hypothesis_eligible":false,"key":"graph_theory.vertex_connectivity","name":"Vertex connectivity","observation_key":"vertex_connectivity","predictor_eligible":true,"provenance_references":["reference:theo-conjecture-web-fresh-graph-registry","source:theox-graph-template-normalization"],"role":"established","scalar_constraints":[],"subject":{"kind":"variable","name":"G","sort":{"key":"graph_theory.finite_connected_simple_graph_value","parameters":[]}},"target_eligible":true,"unit":null,"value_kind":"integer","value_sort":{"key":"core.integer_value","parameters":[]}}
