        "definition": "A vertex cover of \\(G\\) is a set \\(S\\subseteq V(G)\\) such that every edge of \\(G\\) has at least one endpoint in \\(S\\). The vertex cover number \\(\\tau(G)\\) is the minimum cardinality of a vertex cover of \\(G\\).",
        "input_sorts": [
