      {
        "body_sort": null,
        "bound_sorts": [],
        "definition": "Write \\( Z(G) \\) for the zero forcing number of a graph \\( G \\). A vertex \\( v \\) of \\( G \\) is zero forcing-critical if \\( Z(G-v) \\ne Z(G) \\). The zero forcing critical vertex count of \\( G \\) is the number of zero forcing-critical vertices of \\( G \\).",
