      {
        "body_sort": null,
        "bound_sorts": [],
        "definition": "For each vertex \\(v\\in V(G)\\), form \\(G-v\\) by deleting \\(v\\) and all incident edges. This invariant counts the vertices for which \\(Z(G-v) < Z(G)\\), where \\(Z\\) denotes the zero forcing number. In other words, it measures how many single-vertex deletions make the zero forcing number strictly decrease.",
