      {
        "body_sort": null,
        "bound_sorts": [],
        "definition": "For a finite connected graph \\(G\\), the zombie-cop gap is \\(z(G)-c(G)\\). Since every zombie strategy is a restricted cop strategy, one has \\(z(G)\\ge c(G)\\); positive values therefore record graphs on which deterministic shortest-path movement is strictly weaker than the freedom allowed in the classical cops-and-robber game.",
