        "definition": "A graph \\(G\\) has the zombie-cop separation property when \\(z(G)>c(G)\\). Equivalently, the deterministic movement rule in the Zombies and Survivor game creates a genuine pursuit-evasion penalty relative to the classical cops-and-robber game.",
